units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
#/atom 1 carbon
#/bond 1 1 1.85
lattice custom 1.0 a1 2.4595121467 0 0 a2 0 4.26 0 a3 0 0 12 basis 0 0 0 basis 0.5 0.1666666666667 0 basis 0.5 0.5 0 basis 0 0.6666666666667 0
region simulation block -8 28 -8 29 -10 10 units box
create_box 1 simulation
region sheet block 0 7.999999 0 4.999999 -0.01 0.01 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region sheet
mass 1 12.011
pair_style airebo 3.0
pair_coeff * * CH.airebo C
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.00025
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-6 1000 10000
velocity all create 100.0 49183 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
fix thermal all langevin 100.0 100.0 0.1 82347 zero yes
run 0
